{"id":1,"title":"Chess Basics","lessons":[{"title":"Your first moves","intro":"Every square has a name: a letter for its column (a to h, left to right from White's side) and a number for its row (1 to 8, starting from White's side). So e4 is column e, row 4. The small labels on the board show each square's name — hover any square name in these lessons to light it up. White moves first. Pawns move straight forward: two squares on their first move, one square after that. Knights jump in an L shape.","tasks":[{"kind":"goal","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1","goal":{"type":"move","from":"e2","to":"e4"},"prompt":"Move the e-pawn forward two squares: e2 to e4."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1","goal":{"type":"move","from":"g1","to":"f3"},"prompt":"Move the knight from g1 to f3."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1","goal":{"type":"move","from":"d2","to":"d3"},"prompt":"Move the d-pawn forward just one square: d2 to d3."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1","goal":{"type":"move","from":"b1","to":"c3"},"prompt":"Move the knight from b1 to c3."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1","goal":{"type":"move","from":"c2","to":"c4"},"prompt":"Move the c-pawn forward two squares: c2 to c4."}],"id":"1-1"},{"title":"The rook","intro":"The rook (worth 5 pawns) moves any number of squares in a straight line — up, down, left or right — but can't jump over pieces. It captures the same way.","tasks":[{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/2k3pR/8/8/8/8/5K2/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"g7"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your rook."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/8/8/p7/R7/4k3/2K5/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"a5"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your rook."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/8/2R5/k7/4K3/2p5/8/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"c3"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your rook."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"2K5/8/p7/7k/8/8/8/R7 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"a6"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your rook."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/3R4/1K1p4/8/1k6/8/8/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"d6"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your rook."}],"id":"1-2"},{"title":"The bishop","intro":"The bishop (worth 3) moves any number of squares diagonally. Each bishop stays on one color of square for the whole game.","tasks":[{"kind":"goal","fen":"6B1/8/4p3/2k5/8/8/8/7K w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"e6"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your bishop."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"7k/2B5/5K2/8/5p2/8/8/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"f4"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your bishop."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"6k1/3B4/8/5p2/8/8/8/6K1 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"f5"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your bishop."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/1p6/8/8/6k1/8/5KB1/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"b7"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your bishop."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/K6k/8/8/6p1/7B/8/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"g4"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your bishop."}],"id":"1-3"},{"title":"The queen","intro":"The queen (worth 9) is the strongest piece: she moves like a rook and a bishop combined — any distance in a straight line or diagonal.","tasks":[{"kind":"goal","fen":"5K2/8/8/8/Q2p3k/8/8/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"d4"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your queen."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"5K2/8/5p2/6Q1/8/8/8/7k w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"f6"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your queen."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/5p2/8/8/5k2/2K5/Q7/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"f7"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your queen."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"3k4/Q7/4K3/8/8/4p3/8/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"e3"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your queen."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/8/8/6K1/8/5pQ1/8/1k6 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"f3"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your queen."}],"id":"1-4"},{"title":"The king","intro":"The king moves one square in any direction. He's the most important piece: if he's trapped (checkmate), you lose.","tasks":[{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/8/2k5/8/5Kp1/8/3K4/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"g4"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your king."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/2k5/8/3Kp3/8/7K/8/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"e5"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your king."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"1K6/2p2K2/8/8/8/8/5k2/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"c7"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your king."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/8/7K/6p1/8/5K2/k7/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"g5"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your king."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/8/8/k7/8/6p1/6K1/5K2 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"g3"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your king."}],"id":"1-5"},{"title":"The knight","intro":"The knight (worth 3) moves in an L: two squares one way, then one square sideways. It's the only piece that can jump over others.","tasks":[{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/8/8/5K2/2k5/2p5/8/1N6 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"c3"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your knight."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"2N1k3/4p3/8/4K3/8/8/8/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"e7"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your knight."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/k2N4/8/2p5/8/8/8/7K w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"c5"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your knight."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/8/8/8/3K4/5p2/7k/6N1 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"f3"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your knight."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"N6k/8/1p6/8/4K3/8/8/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"b6"},"prompt":"Capture the black pawn with your knight."}],"id":"1-6"},{"title":"Pawn captures","intro":"Pawns move straight ahead but capture diagonally — one square forward to the left or right. They can never move backward.","tasks":[{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/1b6/2P5/8/8/1k6/8/5K2 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"b7"},"prompt":"Capture the black piece with your pawn."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/8/8/1K6/7k/6n1/7P/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"g3"},"prompt":"Capture the black piece with your pawn."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"7K/5p2/6P1/8/8/8/8/k7 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"f7"},"prompt":"Capture the black piece with your pawn."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/8/2b5/1P6/5k2/8/8/5K2 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"c6"},"prompt":"Capture the black piece with your pawn."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/8/3k4/8/b7/1P6/K7/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"a4"},"prompt":"Capture the black piece with your pawn."}],"id":"1-7"},{"title":"Promotion","intro":"When a pawn reaches the far side of the board it promotes — it becomes a queen, rook, bishop or knight (almost always a queen).","tasks":[{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/P7/8/8/k7/8/8/4K3 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"promote"},"prompt":"Push your pawn to the last rank and promote it."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/2P5/8/8/k7/8/8/4K3 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"promote"},"prompt":"Push your pawn to the last rank and promote it."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/3P4/8/8/k7/8/8/4K3 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"promote"},"prompt":"Push your pawn to the last rank and promote it."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/5P2/8/8/k7/8/8/4K3 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"promote"},"prompt":"Push your pawn to the last rank and promote it."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/7P/8/8/k7/8/8/4K3 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"promote"},"prompt":"Push your pawn to the last rank and promote it."}],"id":"1-8"},{"title":"Castling","intro":"Castling moves your king two squares toward a rook, and the rook jumps to the other side of the king — in one move. You can't castle if the king or rook has moved, if pieces are in the way, or out of or through check.","tasks":[{"kind":"goal","fen":"r3k2r/pppq1ppp/2npbn2/2b1p3/2B1P3/2NPBN2/PPPQ1PPP/R3K2R w KQkq - 0 1","goal":{"type":"castle","side":"k"},"prompt":"Castle kingside (short castling): click your king, then the square two to its right."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"r3k2r/pppq1ppp/2npbn2/2b1p3/2B1P3/2NPBN2/PPPQ1PPP/R3K2R w KQkq - 0 1","goal":{"type":"castle","side":"q"},"prompt":"Castle queenside (long castling): click your king, then the square two to its left."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"rnbqk2r/pppp1ppp/5n2/2b1p3/2B1P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQK2R w KQkq - 4 4","goal":{"type":"castle","side":"k"},"prompt":"A real opening position: castle kingside to get your king safe."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"r1bqkbnr/pp3ppp/2n1p3/2ppP3/3P4/2PB1N2/PP3PPP/RNBQK2R w KQkq - 0 1","goal":{"type":"castle","side":"k"},"prompt":"Castle kingside."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"r3kbnr/ppp2ppp/2nq4/3p1b2/3P4/2NBBN2/PPPQ1PPP/R3K2R w KQkq - 0 1","goal":{"type":"castle","side":"q"},"prompt":"Castle queenside to put your king on c1."}],"id":"1-9"},{"title":"En passant","intro":"If an enemy pawn moves two squares and lands right beside your pawn, you may capture it as if it had moved only one square. You must do it immediately, or the chance is gone.","tasks":[{"kind":"goal","fen":"4k3/8/8/3pP3/8/8/8/4K3 w - d6 0 1","goal":{"type":"enpassant"},"prompt":"Black just played d7–d5. Capture it en passant with your e-pawn."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"4k3/8/8/2pP4/8/8/8/4K3 w - c6 0 1","goal":{"type":"enpassant"},"prompt":"Black just played c7–c5. Capture it en passant with your d-pawn."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"4k3/8/8/5pP1/8/8/8/4K3 w - f6 0 1","goal":{"type":"enpassant"},"prompt":"Black just played f7–f5. Capture it en passant with your g-pawn."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"4k3/8/8/1pP5/8/8/8/4K3 w - b6 0 1","goal":{"type":"enpassant"},"prompt":"Black just played b7–b5. Capture it en passant with your c-pawn."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"4k3/8/8/6pP/8/8/8/4K3 w - g6 0 1","goal":{"type":"enpassant"},"prompt":"Black just played g7–g5. Capture it en passant with your h-pawn."}],"id":"1-10"},{"title":"Giving check","intro":"When a piece attacks the enemy king, that's check. The opponent must get out of check on their very next move.","tasks":[{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/K7/8/6k1/8/8/8/Q7 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"check"},"prompt":"Give check: attack the black king."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/4K3/8/8/8/1R6/8/5k2 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"check"},"prompt":"Give check: attack the black king."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"2B5/2K5/8/1k6/8/8/8/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"check"},"prompt":"Give check: attack the black king."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"4k3/K7/8/8/6N1/8/8/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"check"},"prompt":"Give check: attack the black king."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/R2K4/8/8/8/4k3/8/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"check"},"prompt":"Give check: attack the black king."}],"id":"1-11"},{"title":"Getting out of check","intro":"There are three ways out of check: move the king to a safe square, block the attack with another piece, or capture the attacking piece. If none works, it's checkmate.","tasks":[{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/8/8/7k/8/R3q3/8/2K5 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"legal"},"prompt":"You're in check! Get out of it: move your king, block the attack, or capture the attacker."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/8/8/6k1/4q3/1R3K2/8/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"legal"},"prompt":"You're in check! Get out of it: move your king, block the attack, or capture the attacker."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"7k/8/3n4/1K6/6R1/8/8/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"legal"},"prompt":"You're in check! Get out of it: move your king, block the attack, or capture the attacker."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/7k/3K4/8/8/5R2/8/3q4 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"legal"},"prompt":"You're in check! Get out of it: move your king, block the attack, or capture the attacker."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"2R5/8/8/8/8/2q5/1K6/7k w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"legal"},"prompt":"You're in check! Get out of it: move your king, block the attack, or capture the attacker."}],"id":"1-12"},{"title":"Piece values","intro":"Pieces are worth different amounts: pawn 1, knight 3, bishop 3, rook 5, queen 9. When you can take something for free, take the most valuable piece.","tasks":[{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/8/k1K2n2/8/8/8/3b4/3rQ3 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"d1"},"prompt":"Your queen can take more than one piece. Capture the most valuable one."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"4K3/8/8/3Q2n1/3r4/b7/8/3k4 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"d4"},"prompt":"Your queen can take more than one piece. Capture the most valuable one."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"3K4/8/3Qr3/3n4/8/3k4/6b1/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"e6"},"prompt":"Your queen can take more than one piece. Capture the most valuable one."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"8/5k2/8/2r1b2n/3Q2K1/8/8/8 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"c5"},"prompt":"Your queen can take more than one piece. Capture the most valuable one."},{"kind":"goal","fen":"1k6/8/4p3/8/8/4n3/K7/1rQ5 w - - 0 1","goal":{"type":"capture","square":"b1"},"prompt":"Your queen can take more than one piece. Capture the most valuable one."}],"id":"1-13"},{"title":"Your first checkmate","intro":"Checkmate in one move. Look at every check you can give — one of them leaves the king with no escape. Checkmate means the king is attacked and can't escape — that wins the game.","tasks":[{"kind":"puzzle","fen":"N1b1k2r/1q2ppb1/p1np2p1/8/Q3PP1p/4BN1P/PPP3P1/1K1R2n1 w k - 1 20","moves":["e3g1","b7b2"],"rating":550,"id":"0H2XQ"},{"kind":"puzzle","fen":"3r1r1k/p4ppp/1p6/6PN/b6P/4RP2/PP3Q2/2Kq2R1 w - - 5 31","moves":["g1d1","d8d1"],"rating":550,"id":"0x3Vh"},{"kind":"puzzle","fen":"4r1k1/p1p2ppp/1bQp4/8/8/2P2NR1/PP3PPP/4q1K1 w - - 3 25","moves":["f3e1","e8e1"],"rating":550,"id":"19pSw"},{"kind":"puzzle","fen":"2nr1Bk1/1p1q1ppp/p1b1p3/4P3/2PR2Q1/1P4P1/P4PBP/6K1 b - - 6 23","moves":["d7d4","g4g7"],"rating":550,"id":"1X9RJ"},{"kind":"puzzle","fen":"r4rk1/pp2qppp/2pp2n1/8